---
/**
 * Music: the Spotify playlist, built on open.
 *
 * The window soundtracks are not here and are not a playlist. They belong to Work and to
 * Feedback, they start when those windows open, and the only control over them is pause,
 * in the speaker panel in the menu bar. A row of play buttons here would be a second way
 * to choose a track, which is the one thing that feature is not.
 *
 * Nothing costs anything until this window opens, and then one iframe is injected.
 */
---
<div class="music">
  <section>
    <p class="music__label">PLAYLIST</p>
    <div id="spotify-box"><p class="music__empty">Loading the playlist from Spotify…</p></div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .music { min-height: 200px; display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .music__label { margin: 0 0 var(--space-2); font: 10px var(--font-chrome); letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--os-muted); }


  .music__empty { font: 12px var(--font-mono); color: var(--os-muted); margin: 0; }
</style>
